OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FHeavy,
OL,6,Fblustery showers continue tonight with
OL,7,Fa risk of thunder and hail at times.
OL,8,FWinds will remain strong towards
OL,9,Fsouthwestern coasts and near showers,
OL,10,Fbut becoming lighter elsewhere. A
OL,11,Fmilder night than Wednesday night for
OL,12,Fmost.
OL,13,
OL,14,CFriday:FOn Friday, showers dissipate,
OL,15,Fwith sunny intervals developing away
OL,16,Ffrom lingering low cloud in the east.
OL,17,FWinds ease and daytime temperatures
OL,18,Fare near average, but cold overnight
OL,19,Fwith patchy frost.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
