OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FAfter
OL,6,Fa frosty start, sunny spells for many
OL,7,Fon Saturday. Overnight, heavy rain and
OL,8,Fstrong winds arrive and persist
OL,9,Fthrough Sunday, with showers on
OL,10,FMonday. Turning milder.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
